    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>description</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Solartech Services Foundation (SSF) was incorporated in Bangladesh on 01 January 2023 as a company.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;SSF was found with a objective to develop, supply and promoting environment friendly, sustainable and renewable energy including Solar Home System (SHS), bio-mass and all other renewable sources and all conventional and innovative technologies, energy efficient technology and equipment&amp;rsquo;s to rural areas of Bangladesh. It also work in all the areas of environment, social &amp;amp; human development to improve life standard and poverty alleviation of rural poor people.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
