      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;/td&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;td width=&quot;438&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Sr. Executive Engineer&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;/td&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;/tr&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;/tbody&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;/table&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;OUR PROGRAMS:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;SSF, in areas of environment, social and human development including community engagement, economic empowerment and social business, renewable energy of&amp;nbsp; Bangladesh.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Installation of SHS (Solar Home System)&lt;/strong&gt;: One of the main activities of SSF. Since its inception in 2023, SSF has installed Solar Home System (SHS) across the country.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gov. and NGO Project: &lt;/strong&gt;SSF has implemented upazila project across the country installing wide range of solar energy solutions including street lights, SHS and home appliances. SSF has installed lot of SHS, Solar Street Lights, AC with Net-metering and DC system.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Biogas Plant&lt;/strong&gt;: To address unavailability of natural gas in rural areas, SSF is interested constructing Bio-Gas plant.&amp;nbsp; SSF provides total solution of plant including after sales service.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Installation of Lightning Arrester&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;Under the Department of Disaster Management Solartech Services Foundation has installation Lightning Arrester in Hosenpur upazila of Kishorganj District. SSF aim is to ensure that no one dies after being struck by lightning.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Solartech Services Foundation is competent in all activities-&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;ul&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;li&gt;Installation, Maintenance &amp;amp; Repair of Solar Street Light (SSL).&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;li&gt;Installation of Lightning Arrester.&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;li&gt;Installation of Solar Home System (SHS).&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;li&gt;Installation of Solar Off-Grid &amp;amp; On-Grid.&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;li&gt;Supply of IPS &amp;amp;UPS.&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3577 characters\">&lt;/ul&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
  </samp>]
