      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"10012 characters\">&lt;div class=&quot;AdPoic&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Types of Lightning Arresters&lt;button class=&quot;rBl3me&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-amic=&quot;true&quot; data-icl-uuid=&quot;9119f4f2-28b7-45e2-a638-5120aa53e70c&quot; aria-label=&quot;View related links&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;disabled=JQ2klf_2h_C5gNJc;class=JQ2klf_2h_UpSNec;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjGxP_lhYaRAxWmXWwGHQmOON4Qye0OegQICRAA&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"10012 characters\">&lt;div class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAoQAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Various types of lightning arresters exist, selected based on factors like voltage rating, application, and cost. Common types include:&lt;span class=&quot;uJ19be notranslate&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;JQ2klf_2l,JQ2klf_2m,JQ2klf_2n&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vKEkVd&quot; data-animation-atomic=&quot;&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;button class=&quot;rBl3me&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-amic=&quot;true&quot; data-icl-uuid=&quot;450f7606-3f90-4cb3-a6f0-afe01d6540df&quot; aria-label=&quot;View related links&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;disabled=JQ2klf_2l_C5gNJc;class=JQ2klf_2l_UpSNec;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjGxP_lhYaRAxWmXWwGHQmOON4Qye0OegQIChAB&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"10012 characters\">&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
