      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"10012 characters\">&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAsQAQ&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Metal Oxide (MOV) Arrester&lt;/strong&gt;: A modern, highly effective type that uses zinc oxide discs as non-linear resistors. They are widely used in high-voltage systems and require less maintenance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
